return ['domain'=>'zinn-connector','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'ha','project-id-version'=>'zinn-connector','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-02T07:33:53+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-02T07:33:53+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Connector'=>'Zinn® Connector','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-connector'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-connector','Connects this WordPress site to Zinn Digital® so scheduled articles can be published to it. Paste a pairing code from your Zinn® dashboard and the plugin sets up its own credential — nothing is copied by hand.'=>'Yana haɗa wannan rukunin yanar gizon WordPress zuwa Zinn Digital® domin a iya wallafa labaran da aka tsara lokaci a ciki. Liƙa lambar haɗawa daga allon sarrafa Zinn® kuma plugin ɗin yana saita nasa shaidar — ba a kwafin komai da hannu.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','This site\'s PHP cannot create archives, so a backup could not be made.'=>'PHP na wannan shafin ba zai iya ƙirƙirar ɗakunan ajiya ba, don haka ba a iya yin ajiyar bayanai ba.','Could not create a temporary file.'=>'An kasa ƙirƙirar fayil ɗin wucin gadi.','This site\'s files could not be archived.'=>'Ba a iya adana fayilolin wannan shafin ba.','The archive could not be read back.'=>'Ba a iya karanta ma\'ajiyar bayanai ba.','The backup could not be uploaded.'=>'Ba a iya loda ajiyar ba.','The backup upload was rejected.'=>'An ƙi amincewa da loda madadin.','This WordPress user cannot publish posts, so a connection made now could not publish either. Sign in as a user who can, and try again.'=>'Wannan mai amfani na WordPress ba zai iya buga rubuce-rubuce ba, don haka haɗin da aka yi yanzu ba zai iya bugawa ba ko kadan. Shiga azaman mai amfani wanda zai iya, sannan ka sake gwadawa.','Application passwords are turned off on this site, so we cannot create a credential. Ask your host to enable them, or connect the site with a password you create yourself in your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'An kashe kalmomin sirri na aikace-aikace a kan wannan shafin, don haka ba za mu iya ƙirƙirar takardar shaidar ba. Roƙi mai masaukin baƙi naka ya kunna su, ko kuma ka haɗa shafin tare da kalmar sirri da kuka ƙirƙira da kanka a cikin kundin tsarin mulkin ku na Zinn Digital®.','WordPress would not create a credential for this site. Nothing has been sent anywhere.'=>'WordPress ba za ta iya ƙirƙirar takardar shaida don wannan shafin ba. Ba a tura komai ko\'ina ba.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this site. Nothing was connected, and the credential we made has been removed. Check the site can make outgoing requests, and try again.'=>'Ba mu iya isa ga Zinn Digital® daga wannan shafin ba. Babu abin da aka haɗa, kuma an cire shaidar da muka yi. Bincika cewa shafin zai iya yin buƙatun fitarwa, kuma a gwada kuma.','Zinn Digital® did not accept that pairing code. Nothing was connected. Generate a fresh code in your dashboard and try again.'=>'Zinn Digital® bai karɓi wannan lambar haɗin ba. Ba a haɗa komai ba. Samar da sabuwar lamba a cikin allon sarrafa ku kuma sake gwadawa.','Connected. Zinn Digital® can now publish to this site.'=>'An haɗa. Zinn Digital® yanzu zai iya bugawa zuwa wannan shafin.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — jagorori da ayyuka','User guides'=>'Jagororin mai amfani','Read the %s user guide'=>'Karanta jagorar mai amfani ta %s','Hide this'=>'Boye da wannan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Zinn® hosting don WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, madogaransa na kullum, ƙaura kyauta da kuma allon sarrafawa da aka gina don mutanen da ke gudanar da shafuka fiye da ɗaya.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Kasuwancin Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Sayen da siyar da ingantattun shafuka, yanki, da kuma wuraren sanya hanyoyin sadarwa, tare da ajiyar kuɗi cikin aminci har sai bangarorin biyu sun gamsu.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — hayar mutanen da ke yin wannan a matsayin sana\'a','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Kasuwar mu ta masu zaman kansu ta duniya: bincika sama da sabis 10,000 da aka riga aka shirya daga marubuta, masu zanen kaya, masu haɓakawa da ƙwararrun SEO, ko sanya wani aikin kuma bari su yi fare.','This site is connected to Zinn Digital®, publishing as %s.'=>'An haɗa wannan shafin da Zinn Digital®, yana wallafawa azaman %s.','To disconnect, revoke the “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” application password on %s.'=>'Domin cire haɗin, a soke kalmar sirri ta aikace-aikace ta “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” a kan %s.','your profile'=>'bayanin martabarka','Connect this site'=>'Haɗa wannan shafin','Open your Zinn Digital® dashboard, go to Content → Other sites, and press “Get a pairing code”. Paste it below.'=>'Buɗe allo na Zinn Digital®, je zuwa Abubuwan Ciki → Sauran shafuka, sannan ka danna “Get a pairing code”. Liƙe shi a ƙasa.','Pairing code'=>'Lambar haɗawa','It expires thirty minutes after you generate it, and can only be used once.'=>'Yana ƙarewa bayan mintuna talatin da samar da shi, kuma za a iya amfani da shi sau ɗaya ne kawai.','You are not allowed to connect this site.'=>'Ba a ba ku izinin haɗa wannan shafin ba.']];